{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"Implement the adaptive byte/replay-cost snapshot cadence accepted by ADR 0118, default OFF globally. Preserve existing fixed-count behavior when `compact.snapshot_alpha` is unset or `<= 0`. Add config/env handling consistent with existing compact keys, pass pending-source and active-snapshot byte counts into the compaction trigger, preserve ADR 0035 fold horizon/retire/rebuild semantics, and add focused unit tests.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `compact.snapshot_alpha` is a typed compact config key with default `0.0`; unset or `<= 0` preserves the existing fixed-count/backfill cadence.\n- [ ] The definition site includes the exact mechanism marker `# mechanism-ok: config_key compact.snapshot_alpha — da70-18a5-898d-47ea`.\n- [ ] When `compact.snapshot_alpha > 0`, a ticket with an active snapshot folds when pending foldable source bytes are `>= snapshot_alpha * active_snapshot_bytes`, while the existing count threshold still triggers folding.\n- [ ] First-snapshot backfill remains unchanged: foldable events with no active snapshot still fold, and zero foldable events do not.\n- [ ] ADR 0035 semantics remain intact: conservative horizon, retired source/snapshot handling, rebuild-on-stray behavior, mixed-version rollback, and no snapshot event schema change.\n- [ ] Sweep compaction and per-close trigger selection use the same adaptive decision rule.\n\n## Testing\n- [ ] Run `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/unit/commands/test_compact_plan.py tests/unit/test_config_typed.py tests/unit/test_config_ev3a_aliases.py -q`.\n- [ ] Run `env -u GIT_CONFIG_COUNT -u GIT_CONFIG_KEY_0 -u GIT_CONFIG_VALUE_0 -u GIT_CONFIG_KEY_1 -u GIT_CONFIG_VALUE_1 -u GIT_CONFIG_KEY_2 -u GIT_CONFIG_VALUE_2 PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make verify PYTEST_WORKERS=2` before push."}},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1788961532134766001,"uuid":"00538a4e-7ded-4187-b3d6-03f10875b2cc"}